cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ga4-sparkify"
abstract: >-
  Storage- and service-agnostic Spark jobs for flattening GA4 BigQuery-export
  event data into a wide, pivoted schema. The GA4-export input format and the
  flattened output schema are fixed; the storage backend and the Spark engine
  that runs the job are configurable.
